#
# Curated technical/acronym allow-list for the production English system
# lexicon. One surface form per line; lines starting with '#' are comments.
# Entries are curated technical terms and acronyms shipped with canonical
# display casing (a colliding source word is replaced on the canonical
# display; the lowercase literal remains a parallel arc, D071). Keys must be
# reachable through the Pinyin composition path: letters with optional
# internal apostrophes only. See AUDIT.md §6.
