# Reviewed for the same release and NOT added: sing-box, Node.js, Next.js,
# llama.cpp, Pi-hole, fine-tune. Their display forms need "-" or ".", which
# the generator's surface filter skips, and admitting them would break the
# shipped resource invariant key == lowercase(display), which holds for every
# row of the resource (22477 before these additions, 22517 after) - see the
# release report.
